      "notes": [
        "wholeOD-flow系列를representation→HAC→cluster joint-vector predictor→TM재구성. H200 one-layerGRU/10history/80–20+train10%val/batch32/100epochs/Adam.001/earlystop5. 2025H30과차이·scope/scale구분. prototype/head저자implementation 미검증.",
        "Histogram50bins/log2 JSD complete linkage; ACF euclidean/average linkage; PSDWelch/euclidean/average. naive는random label절차로설명하지만TableV에서는balanced크기6–7/10–11을보고. exactseed/저자랜덤코드 미검증; 모든random분할이그크기라는보장 아님.",
        "TableI운영K Abilene21/21/41/21 및GEANT40/100/100/50. TableII testMbps RMSE는그운영K. ARI/NMI는K21/40로맞춤. 같은K 구조분석과다른K 성능비교를혼합안함. naive이득은모델단위/parametercapacity/분할과관계, scalarRCTL로직접승격안함.",
        "K-sweep Δ10·five trials mean/errorbars·Kneedle에RMSE-Kcurve사용. 확인한본문은어떤split으로curve/K를정했는지명확히표시안함. seed/normalizer fit기간/clustering사용구간/실측runtime경계와hardware미검증.",
        "운영K근처 유사RMSE와상이한partition이관찰되었고원문은더작은K에서representation역할가능성을명시. 모든K/모든자료에서grouping무효 또는global 불가능로확대안함.",
        "p7 localAbilene120–150분 vsp9 150–200분의범위차이·Fig3Abilene끝tick143 vs본문local144는그대로범위문제로보존. minutes를우리95 CPU16cell milliseconds나10000cell end-to-end로환산안함.",
