      "findings": [
        "PEMS-BAY N180 days,T288,P325 (PDF19–20); PEMS-SF N440 days,T144,P963 (PDF23). Sensors are components, not clustering objects.",
        "Each MTS has its own chronological TRAIN/VAL/TEST split; TRAIN-only imputation/standardization. Fit GLOBAL and prototypes on TRAIN, reassign/K-select on VAL, freeze fallback before TRAIN+VAL refit and single TEST (PDF6–14,37).",
        "Shared encoder/decoder, GRU prototypes/warm-start regularization; repeated forecaster training is part of this method, not a forecaster-free partition rule.",
